/android/app/release

# Copied from web/sqlite3.wasm at test time so flutter_tools' static handler
# can serve it to the Chrome test run. Not a second tracked copy — see ADR
# 0009.
/test/sqlite3.wasm

# Copied from the Flutter SDK on Windows only. flutter_tools'
# _localCanvasKitHandler builds its path with `path.fromUri` and then guards
# on `startsWith('canvaskit/')`, which never matches a backslash path, so the
# engine assets 404 and Chrome never reaches a test. The next handler in the
# cascade serves <cwd>/test correctly, so a copy here is what gets served.
# See app/README.md's Testing section.
/test/canvaskit/
